==Other methods==

===Level 1–5: Headless arrows===
A profitable way of training Fletching is to fletch [[headless arrow]]s using [[arrow shaft]]s and [[feather]]s. This grants 15 experience per action, for 1 experience per headless arrow fletched.

=== Level 1–5/10: Arrow shafts ===
{{plinkp|Arrow shaft}} The best way to get from level 1 to level 5 is by fletching [[Arrow shaft|arrow shafts]], which give 5 experience per log.

